NEARS-718 — Search suggestion debounce / min-char gate / stale-guard
Live network evidence (adb logcat, api_client "API Response" lines), device emulator-5556, zone 2 Abu Dhabi, user james.wilson@demo.com
Suggestion endpoint: /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search ; unified endpoint: /api/v1/search/unified (kSuggestionDebounceMs=200, kSearchDebounceMs=350, kMinSearchChars=2)

=== AC1 — debounce coalesces a fast burst to ONE request ===
Burst "chicken" (7 chars typed on-device in 103ms):
  1 x  /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search?name=chicken
  1 x  /api/v1/search/unified?name=chicken&offset=1&limit=10
  => 7 keystrokes -> 1 suggestion request (a per-keystroke impl would fire ~6).

Burst "tomato" (6 chars, tight loop):
  01:14:42.205  /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search?name=tomato
  01:14:42.404  /api/v1/search/unified?name=tomato&offset=1&limit=10
  => 6 keystrokes -> 1 suggestion request.

=== AC2 — newest query wins, no stale overwrite ===
Typed "to", paused 500ms, then "mato" (forces TWO debounced cycles):
  [200] /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search?name=to
  [200] /api/v1/search/unified?name=to&offset=1&limit=10
  [200] /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search?name=tomato
  [200] /api/v1/search/unified?name=tomato&offset=1&limit=10
  Final on-screen results: Items (5) — all TOMATO (Fresh Organic Tomato, Tomato Sauce, Tomatoes).
  => the newest settled query ("tomato") is displayed; the older "to" never overwrites it.
  (stale-guard: _dispatchSuggestion drops a response whose _suggestionReqId was superseded.)

=== AC4 — min-char gate (kMinSearchChars=2) ===
1 char "a":
  (no item-or-store-search request, no unified request)  -> idle state (Popular Categories) stays, NO strip fetch.
2 chars "ap":
  [200] /api/v1/items/item-or-store-search?name=ap
  [200] /api/v1/search/unified?name=ap&offset=1&limit=10   -> fetch fires.
Delete 2->1 ("ap" -> "a"):
  (no new request fired)  -> below-gate cancels; debouncedSuggestion applies ([], show=false) => _showSuggestion=false (strip hidden).

=== AC7b — NEARS-628 See all -> Load More pagination ===
"ap" -> Items (12), "See All" -> expanded Items list (page 1 = 10 items, "Load More" button present).
Tapped "Load More":
  [200] /api/v1/search/unified?name=ap&offset=2&limit=10   (offset=2 = 1-based page 2)
  -> remaining items appended (new card "Seedless Grapes / Supermarket"); "Load More" button disappears (all 12 loaded).

=== Logs-first gate ===
Full-session logcat scan: no [FAIL]/[ERR]/EXCEPTION/overflow/subtype errors; Dart runtime errors: none; all search API responses [200]. Clean.
